        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gak go̱kä kɛ Ya-rɔ-baam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ cu raan Kuɔth ben kä Juda kɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial wëë kä Beth-ɛl. Kä Ya-rɔ-baam tëë cuŋä nhiam yi̱kä kɛ ɣöö bɛ wal tin kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth wiee kɛ kui̱ yi̱kä kɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial wëë i̱ “Aɣ yi̱k, yi̱k ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar i̱, ‘Nɛnɛ, tekɛ gat mi ba dap dhɔr Dee-bid, kä ba ciötdɛ cɔli Yo-ci-yaa. Kä bɛ muc thöp wi̱i̱du ala bo̱o̱th palä guäth palä mi bi wal waŋ wi̱i̱du, kä ba nɛy ti ba dap waŋ wi̱i̱du.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nyuuth ŋun ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ wëë i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ nyuuth in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar i̱, ‘Nɛnɛ yi̱k ba da̱k piny, kä ba ŋɛ̈th in te thi̱n wuɔc dɔɔr.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci kuäär ruac ran Kuɔth liŋ, min cɛ lat kɛ kui̱ yi̱kä kä Beth-ɛl. Cu Ya-rɔ-baam jɛ nyoth wi̱i̱ yi̱kä wëë i̱, “Ka̱pɛ jɛ.” Kä cu tetdɛ min cɛ nyoth ni jɛ kööt, a /cɛ dëë nyɔk kɛ loc puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yi̱k tɛɛth bä, kä cu ŋɛ̈th rɔ wuɔc dɔɔr wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, ce̱tnikɛ nyuuth in ci raan Kuɔth ɛ ŋun ala riet Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär raan Kuɔth jiök i̱, “Pal Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu täämɛ. Kä thiec ɛ kɛ kui̱dä, kɛ ɣöö dëë tetdä luny puɔ̱nydä.” Kä cu raan Kuɔth, Kuoth Nhial pal. Kä cu tet kua̱r loc puɔ̱nydɛ, a bɛ ce̱tnikɛ ta̱a̱dɛ min wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär raan Kuɔth jiök i̱, “Wanɛ cieŋ kɛɛl, bi puɔ̱nydu wä tur, kä bä ji̱ wä col.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth kuäär loc i̱, “Cäŋ bi ɣä ka̱m tha̱a̱ŋ dhɔaaru, /cä bi wä kɛɛl kɛ ji̱. Kä /cä bi mi̱th kiɛ /cä pi̱ bi math ɛn wa̱nɛ mɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ca ɣä jiök ɛ Kuoth Nhial i̱, ‘/Cu mi̱th, kä /cu mäth kɛ pi̱ kä /cu loc jɔk kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in bäkɛ ji̱.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä kɛ duɔ̱p dɔ̱diɛn mi /ci mɔ a duɔ̱p in wä kɛ jɛ kä Beth-ɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gök Beth-ɛl ëë wal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ tëë kɛ gök mi cieŋ kä Beth-ɛl ni walkä cu gatdɛ jɛ ben la̱t tin diaal tin ci raan Kuɔth kɛ la̱t kä Beth-ɛl ɛn cäŋ ɛ mɔ. Amäni ruac in cɛ la̱t kuäär, cukɛ jɛ la̱t gua̱ndiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gua̱ndiɛn kɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p ith cɛ wä kɛ jɛ mɔ?” Kä cu gaatkɛ jɛ nyuɔ̱th duɔ̱ɔ̱p in ci raan Kuɔth in bëë kä Juda wä kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ gaatkɛ jiök i̱, “Rialɛ muulä ikä.” Kä cukɛ muul rialikä kɛ kui̱dɛ kä cuɛ kɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä kɔɔr ran Kuɔth, kä cuɛ jɛ jek nyuurä thaar jiath thëëp. Kä cuɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ jɛn ji̱n raan Kuɔth min bä kä Juda?” Kä cuɛ wëë, “Ɛ ɣän.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Bër wanɛ cieŋ bi wä mi̱th kɛ kuän.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth ɛ loc i̱, “/Cä bi loc jɔk kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl. /Cä bi mi̱th kä /cä bi maath kɛ pi̱ ɛn wa̱nɛ mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r ɣä i̱, ‘/Cu mi̱th kä /cu mäth kɛ pi̱ kä /cu loc jɔk kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in bäkɛ ji̱.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gök ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ɣän gök ce̱tkɛ ji̱ bä, kä ci jääk Kuɔth Nhial ruac kɛ ɣä wëë i̱, ‘No̱o̱ŋni jɛ jɔk dhɔru kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö bɛ mi̱th kä bɛ maath kɛ pi̱.’ ” Duundɛ ɣöö kacɛ ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. Kä cuɛ mi̱th kä cuɛ maath kɛ pi̱ dhɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cikɛ nyuur wi̱i̱ mi̱eth, cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä gök in naŋ raan Kuɔth jɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ruac kɛ raan Kuɔth in bä kä Juda, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ i̱, ‘Kɛ ɣöö /keni ruac Kuɔth Nhial luɔ̱th. Kɛnɛ ɣöö /keni ruac Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdu min cɛ la̱r ji̱ tit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci luny ni ji̱n jɔk, kä ci mi̱th kä ci maath kɛ pi̱ guäth in cɛ la̱r ji̱ /cu mi̱th thi̱n kä cu mäth. Inɔ /ci ri̱ŋdu bi cop kɔ̱kä guuri.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cikɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ mi̱eth kɛnɛ ma̱th, cuɛ muul rialikä kɛ kui̱ go̱kä min cɛ luɔ̱c jɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wëë kɛ cuɛ röm kɛ lony, kä cu lony ɛ näk. Kä cua puɔ̱nydɛ yuɔr rɛy duɔ̱p, kä cu muul cuɔ̱ŋ gekädɛ. Amäni lony bä cuɛ cuɔ̱ŋ gekä ri̱eŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ cu wutni ben kɛ gëëkdɛ, kä cukɛ ri̱ŋdɛ nɛn ca yuɔr dup, kä te lony cuŋä gekä ri̱eŋdɛ. Kä cukɛ jɛ ben lar wi̱c in cieŋ gök ëë wal thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
